        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, production mix NORDEL</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, production mix NORDEL
Electricity net production shares are based on an annual average for the year 2008 according to IEA Electricity Information.;
UUID: 9565ff56-c6d9-3bb5-b10b-9046cd64ffaa
It includes shares of national electricity production NORDEL member countries (in 2008) at the busbar. It does not include transformation, transport nor distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in NORDEL network / Europe
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current (2004) average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Statistics for 2008
Production volume: GWh
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9565ff56-c6d9-3bb5-b10b-9046cd64ffaa.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
